decision #186 C: the host-bound technical attempt carries campaignId, npcDraftId, attemptRevision and editMode=CREATE_V1|APPEND_N_PLUS_ONE. APPEND_N_PLUS_ONE additionally binds npcUuid and expectedCurrentVersion to the selected current snapshot. The client cannot select or change this mode/binding. All eight wizard stages preserve it; cancel before final commit creates no NPC version or history entry. Sole current authenticated campaign GM; persistent non-archived NPC; current campaign/npcUuid and expectedCurrentVersion match. UI-CMD-NPC-NEW-VERSION phase=OPEN is allowed only from NPC-003/NPC-007 and creates only a bound full-edit attempt from the current snapshot, without changing NPC/currentVersion/history; active combat retains its pinned prior snapshot. Sole current authenticated campaign GM; UI-CMD-NPC-NEW-VERSION phase=COMMIT only from NPC-017 with host-bound APPEND_N_PLUS_ONE attempt; expectedCurrentVersion and attemptRevision are current; all eight stages, sex/race/mass and resolved art validate. Atomically append the full N+1 snapshot/history to the same npcUuid; prior versions and combat pins remain unchanged. COMMIT only: При pre-Start calendar state подтверждены initial time и свежий host-bound PRE_START_INITIAL preview; после Start проверяется CURRENT_CAMPAIGN preview. Без календарного состояния time binding не требуется. Stale time/attempt/campaign revision causes zero write. COMMIT only: Initial trauma authoring is closed and source-valid: one explicit choice per host-bound trauma identity; final entered HP is preserved for TORSO; HEAD penalty=PENDING|CONSUMED and stun=ABSENT|ACTIVE are explicit. ACTIVE requires traumaValue>6, a canonical decimal-string remainingMinutes with exact rational 0<r<=5 and a current typed calendar binding; ABSENT has no timer fields. Retained identities keep original committed facts/anchors. No played damage/RNG event or repeated one-time consequence is synthesized; incomplete/stale/foreign/changed input refuses with zero writes. COMMIT only: ADR0082 composition closure: actual source-bound Trogr strength/included-strength/signed-snapshot facts and immutable history are complete; current symbiont source and SYM-166 capacity are recomputed, not client asserted. ADR0082 skill closure: every charge names START, TRAINING or SYM-166; SYM-166 has current capacity5/0 with retained costs and explicit overfill, no repeated grant or rewriting original pools. ADR0082 initial-state closure: CORE-110 uses exact startsAt+60 schedule or proven NO_EFFECT; combined MON-023/SYM-034 HP uses exact1000 precedence and proven source/time state without replaying activation/expiry consequences. ADR0082 source closure: immutable old snapshots/FINAL/receipts/IDs/timestamps and exact proof prefixes are retained; new facts bind to actual owner/attempt/version/campaign/time and source instances. Unknown, missing, foreign, stale, changed or unproven historical data refuses with zero writes. No invented histories/RNG, unchecked numerical fields or second NPC shell; all new editable choices have actual controls, computed values remain read-only. До первого Start календарное состояние NPC требует подтверждённого начального времени. Только успешный CREATE_V1 или NEW-VERSION phase=COMMIT атомарно сохраняет полную версию/history/receipt и при первом таком commit закрепляет initialTimeLockOrNull на эту минуту. OPEN, draft, навигация, cancel, invalid/stale commit и NPC без календарных таймеров lock не создают. Исторические anchors, версии и receipts неизменны; снятие текущего эффекта, новая версия без таймера, archive/delete не снимают уже сохранённую привязку. После Start используется текущий campaign clock; новые initial-time input, автоматические часы, ADVANCE_TIME, scene/combat context и placement не добавляются. Sole current authenticated GM; same bound pre-Start campaign and saved technical attempt; current attempt/campaign revisions; safe boundary; no conflicting mutation. Host stores campaignId,npcDraftId,attemptRevision,editMode,versionBindingOrNull and returnFormId=NPC-016; browser cannot choose or replace return context. Navigation saves no NPC version/history/time lock. Host-bound npcInitialTimeReturnContextOrNull exists; same GM/campaign/attempt/editMode/version binding and current revisions. Return restores the same technical attempt; changed time/revision requires fresh preview, never a saved NPC version or automatic anchor rebase. Stale context refuses; the ordinary safe CMP-007 exit remains available. Canonical NET-016 primaryActions and workflowCommandIds describe the full form vocabulary in every requirement. In the host-bound NPC initial-time child, the current Start guard requires npcInitialTimeReturnContextOrNull=null and is false: Start is omitted from payload/DOM/a11y/hotkeys. Only initial-time save and safe return are offered according to their own guards; closing the child restores the ordinary campaign context. Historical Start receipts remain immutable. Травмы конечностей сохраняют отдельные identities и суммируются по CORE-119; композиция с онемением следует COMB-031. Для корпуса currentHP уже является итоговым исходным значением: TORSO traumaValue=3 при currentHP=7 сохраняет HP=7; повторная потеря HP при подготовке, preview или commit не применяется. HEAD требует независимого явного выбора penalty=PENDING|CONSUMED и stun=ABSENT|ACTIVE. При traumaValue<=6 ACTIVE запрещён; при >6 допустимы все четыре сочетания. ACTIVE содержит canonical decimal-string remainingMinutes с точным рациональным 0<r<=5 минут и действительную календарную привязку; ABSENT не содержит таймерных полей. Незаполненный выбор не становится default. Фиктивные damage event, RNG, combatActor/turn, полный срок по умолчанию и бессрочное оглушение не создаются. На NPC-016 доступны отдельные controls зоны, resolved значения и причины, penalty=PENDING|CONSUMED и stun=ABSENT|ACTIVE. ACTIVE открывает точный десятичный текст remainingMinutes без Number/parseFloat/valueAsNumber и показывает подтвер